sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Your application
    participant AR as AgenticRetrieveStream
    participant MEM as AgentCore Memory
    participant KB as Managed knowledge base

    App->>AR: question (messages: current turn only)<br/>+ userContext (email) + memoryConfiguration
    AR->>MEM: ListEvents (actorId, sessionId)
    Note over AR: trace: SessionHistoryLoad
    par speculative retrieval
        AR->>KB: raw question, ACL-filtered by userContext
    and new session only
        AR->>MEM: RetrieveMemoryRecords (namespacePath)
    end
    Note over AR: trace: SpeculativeRetrieval<br/>retrievalType BedrockKnowledgeBase + BedrockAgentCoreMemory
    loop up to maxAgentIteration
        Note over AR: trace: Planning<br/>actions: retrieve, memoryRetrieve
        AR->>KB: sub-queries, ACL-filtered by userContext
        opt planner decides memory would help
            AR->>MEM: RetrieveMemoryRecords (planner-composed query)
        end
        Note over AR: trace: Retrieval (per source)
    end
    AR-->>App: responseEvent chunks, then result (answer + citations)
    AR->>MEM: CreateEvent (USER question + ASSISTANT answer)
    MEM-->>MEM: asynchronous extraction → long-term records
